<title>ISRAEL: UNIFIL helicopter crashes in south Lebanon.</title>
<headline>UNIFIL helicopter crashes in south Lebanon.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A United Nations peacekeeping helicopter crashed in south Lebanon on Wednesday, causing casualties, Israeli military sources said.</p>
<p>An Israeli radio report that four people were killed could not be immediately confirmed. The sources said the crash took place near Bint Jbeil town inside Israel's occupation zone in south Lebanon.</p>
</text>
